# inc-1brg A and D: what Storycraft's "Augment which item?" menu offers. Read by
# tools/check_storycraft.sh (seed 1), from the frozen orc bard
# tools/fixtures/chars/orc-bard-reapply-seed1.char. Kept apart from
# storycraft-confirm.keys because that script's @choose aborts the whole run
# when the item is missing, which would hide the menu this one photographs.
# The fixture holds only the created character; setup-orc-bard-reapply-seed1.keys makes the state the old save held (bd inc-10v7f).
@include setup-orc-bard-reapply-seed1.keys
# The A control is a non-weapon that already has a plus. The old save carried Lenses +3 of the Scholar as a
# perk item (a perk is not a choice), so the scene acquires them here (bd inc-10v7f). Any such item would do.
w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
@until "enses" RIGHT
DOWN                    # the list opens on Lenses of Mystic Insight; the next entry is the Scholar's
ENTER
3                       # Item Level 3 gives a +3 item
ENTER
s                       # the item arrives in the air: stow it in the pack
ESC
i
@expect "Lenses +3 of the Scholar"
@dump:inventory-before
ESC
u
@choose "Storycraft"
@dump:augment-menu
ESC
@quit
